  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Who does what",
      "items": [
        "Sim goroutine: game.EncodeSave writes raw gob into a buffer the job then owns, so the worker never reads live state (7.6 ms on the grown 500 colony, PERF-010)",
        "Worker goroutine: savefmt.Compress at gzip BestSpeed, atomicfile's temp, fsync and rename, then the camera sidecar (6.9 ms of gzip, PERF-010)",
        "compose/game wires filesave.NewQueue into SaveHooks.Queue; closeSaves runs after the window closes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Queue rules",
      "items": [
        "One job is written at a time; a waiting job for the same slot and kind (save or view) is replaced in place",
        "A view whose save failed is skipped; Busy is an atomic flag read every frame",
        "Done returns the finished jobs; Wait blocks until none waits or runs; Save after Close is ErrClosed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What the player sees",
      "items": [
        "A dim Saving... row at the toast anchor while the queue is busy, held for at least 45 Updates",
        "A failure: the hint plus a danger toast (Chrome.Alarm, 360 Updates)",
        "A commitment colony whose save before leaving fails stays in the colony"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Evidence",
      "items": [
        "Sources pinned to commit fe0f8604c (local-only)",
        "Timings are the PERF-010 ledger's measurements, not taken for this diagram"
      ]
    }
  ]
